Package: sectorinbriefdata
Title: Producer Pipeline for the Sector-in-Brief Dashboard Artifact
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Thiyaghessan Poongundranar", email = "tpoongundranar@urban.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads canonical NCCS BMF, CORE, and DAF e-file
    inputs from S3, applies per-panel aggregations, and publishes
    vintage-tagged parquet to s3://nccsdata/sector-in-brief/vYYYY.MM/ for
    consumption by the UrbanInstitute/sector-in-brief Shiny dashboard.
